#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:1
msgid "E0017"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `ambiguous_loop_argument`"
msgstr "警告名: `ambiguous_loop_argument`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:5
msgid ""
"This warning applies to an ambiguous reference to the initial state of "
"the deprecated functional-loop syntax. Use a `for` loop with explicit "
"state bindings instead. This makes the current state distinct from the "
"original value, without relying on a pattern alias."
msgstr "この警告は、非推奨の関数型ループ構文における初期状態への曖昧な参照に対して出力されます。代わりに、状態を明示的に束縛する `for` ループを使ってください。パターンの別名に頼らず、現在の状態と元の値を区別できます。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:10
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "対処"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:12
msgid ""
"To refer to the state that changes on each iteration, use the variable "
"bound in the `for` header:"
msgstr "反復ごとに変化する状態を参照するには、`for` のヘッダーで束縛した変数を使います。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn main {\n"
"  let a : StringView = \"asdf\"\n"
"  for remaining = a {\n"
"    match remaining {\n"
"      [_, .. d] => {\n"
"        println(remaining)\n"
"        continue d\n"
"      }\n"
"      [] => break\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:23
#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:38
msgid "Output:"
msgstr "出力:"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:25
msgid ""
"asdf\n"
"sdf\n"
"df\n"
"f\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:28
msgid "To refer to the original value, bind it outside the loop:"
msgstr "元の値を参照するには、ループの外で束縛します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:30
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn main {\n"
"  let a : StringView = \"asdf\"\n"
"  let b = a\n"
"  for remaining = a {\n"
"    match remaining {\n"
"      [_, .. d] => {\n"
"        println(b)\n"
"        continue d\n"
"      }\n"
"      [] => break\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0017.md:40
msgid ""
"asdf\n"
"asdf\n"
"asdf\n"
"asdf\n"
msgstr ""

